    c_related: 'Related work', c_related_v: '<p>Schweke, H. et al. (2022). <a href="https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jcim.1c01269">SURFMAP: a software for mapping in two dimensions protein surface features.</a> <i>J. Chem. Inf. Model.</i> 62(7), 1595–1601.</p><p>Reyes, V. M. (2011). <a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7091412">Representation of protein 3D structures in spherical (ρ, φ, θ) coordinates and two of its potential applications.</a> <i>Interdiscip. Sci.</i></p>',
