    c_biology: 'Biology of GH1', c_biology_v: '<a href="https://www.cazypedia.org/index.php/Glycoside_Hydrolase_Family_1">CAZypedia, GH1</a>; <a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11115901">β-Glucosidases (review)</a>; <a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-019-41300-3">Sci. Rep. 2019, GH1 and lignocellulose</a>; <a href="https://digital.csic.es/handle/10261/439422">Polaina 2026, evolution of GH1</a>; Chen et al. (2018), <i>Nature</i> 553, 461–466, α-klotho. <a href="https://www.cazypedia.org/index.php/Glycoside_Hydrolase_Family_5">GH5</a>, <a href="https://www.cazypedia.org/index.php/Glycoside_Hydrolase_Family_16">GH16</a>, <a href="https://www.cazypedia.org/index.php/Glycoside_Hydrolase_Family_18">GH18</a> and <a href="https://www.cazypedia.org/index.php/Glycoside_Hydrolase_Family_20">GH20</a> in CAZypedia; <a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2910082">Lemieux et al. (2006), hexosaminidase A</a>. <a href="https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/Q9H227">UniProt Q9H227</a>. Consulted on 2026-11-04 and 05.',
